    "Glossary for scripts/translate-lessons-via-claude.mjs — keeps terms consistent across all lesson pages of a language.",
    "ui:    German UI label -> locale key. The translation is read from locales/<lang>.js, so lessons name buttons/tabs exactly as the app shows them.",
    "terms: German technical term -> English term as used in the (human-reviewed) English course.",
    "       Other languages get glossary/<lang>.json, generated once per new term by the script (AI-translated, not reviewed)."
  ],
